        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "832a83b9-5556-5abe-adfb-819fee9e1463",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Kingdom of Slavonia, Slavonian Military Frontier, Military Frontier\n- Organizations: Habsburg Monarchy, Austrian Empire, Austro-Hungarian Empire\n- Concepts: provinces, borderlands\n\nFacts:\n- The Kingdom of Slavonia was a province of the Habsburg Monarchy and existed from 1699 to 1868.\n- The Kingdom of Slavonia was also a province of the Austrian Empire during its existence from 1699 to 1868.\n- The southern parts of these regions belonged to the Slavonian Military Frontier.\n- The Slavonian Military Frontier was a section of the Military Frontier.\n- The Military Frontier was a province along the southern borderland of the Habsburg Monarchy.\n- The Military Frontier later lay along the southern borderland of the Austrian Empire and the Austro-Hungarian Empire.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "a7cbb1a3-2164-5b9d-8443-caa42dae631d",
        "text": "Page: Kingdom of Slavonia. Sentence: The Kingdom of Slavonia (Croatian: \"Kraljevina Slavonija\" ; German: \"Königreich Slawonien\" ; Latin: \"Regnum Sclavoniae\" ; Hungarian: \"Szlavón Királyság\" ) was a province of the Habsburg Monarchy and the Austrian Empire that existed from 1699 to 1868.\nPage: Kingdom of Slavonia. Sentence: The southern parts of these regions were part of the Slavonian Military Frontier, which was a section of the Military Frontier.\nPage: Military Frontier. Sentence: The Military Frontier was a province straddling the southern borderland of the Habsburg Monarchy and later the Austrian and Austro-Hungarian Empire.",
